# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

~> **The token secret is stored in the Terraform state.** The API returns the secret in `attributes.token` and this resource stores it as the sensitive `token` attribute, so anyone with read access to the state can read the credential. Protect the state backend accordingly (encryption at rest, restricted access) and prefer passing the value to consumers via `sensitive` outputs.

